{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792598640, "covers_from": "2026-10-21T16:04:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-21T16:05:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792598700, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-21T16:04:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 23747, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "瑞陽公園時常有各種垃圾，而且雜草一堆有太多的蚊蟲了，路燈也偏暗，長期沒調整", "display_name": "內湖代表 Alex(蘇子錚", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T16:04:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30617, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北市的市容真的讓人不敢恭維。西門町人那麼多整潔很重要。不然想買吃的東西就會很猶豫垃圾桶滿出來好噁.", "display_name": "中正代表 No.30,617", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T16:04:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 55097, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "觀光", "content": "不要讓中國人來", "display_name": "中正代表 No.55,097", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T16:04:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36453, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "台北巿道路不平，申訴巿府都用補的很難看新舊柏油交界也不平，人孔蓋在路中與柏油路鋪不平，騎車要繞開危險", "display_name": "士林代表 No.36,453", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T16:04:47+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8785, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "觀光景點都沒有整體配套，常常一個點結束就沒了", "display_name": "士林代表 No.8,785", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T16:04:55+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10424, "sprite_key": "bear_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "其他", "content": "同志 議題 有什麼政見", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.10,424", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 30617, "sprite_k